--- Overview
Extends vmspool with a completion queue and an extended provider interface, and updates the Docker provider, test utilities and documentation to match.

--- Key Changes
vms/vmspool
  * Add completion queue (completion_queue.go) with tests.
  * Add provider support (provider.go) with tests.
  * Add vm_instance.go and substantially reduce pool.go.
  * Update pool, stats and stop tests, and regenerate the README.

vms/dockervm
  * Extend provider.go for the new provider interface.
  * Update dockerapi pool init tests and the README.

vms/vmstestutil
  * Update the mock and shared pool tests, and the README.

vms
  * Update the top-level README.

--- Breaking Changes
Likely: the provider interface is extended, so external vmspool provider implementations may need updating. This is inferred from the diffstat only, so confirm against the final API.
